---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-11 - Grant Consent
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor STU as Student
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as ConsentsController
    participant S as ConsentService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    STU->>W: Open consent page
    W->>C: GET /api/Consents/me
    C->>S: GetMyConsentsAsync(StudentId)
    S-->>W: Purposes, attributes and state per attribute
    STU->>W: Tick attributes of "Wellbeing support", optional expiry date
    W->>C: POST /api/Consents {consentPurposeId, dataAttributeIds, expiresAt}
    C->>S: CreateAsync(StudentId, request)
    S->>R: Check purpose active, attributes active and covered, expiry in the future
    loop each attribute
        alt not granted yet
            S->>R: PrepareCreate Consent (granted) and ConsentHistory (null -> granted)
        else granted but expired
            S->>R: PrepareUpdate Consent (renewed) and ConsentHistory
        end
    end
    S->>R: SaveAsync()
    R->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE CONSENTS, INSERT CONSENTHISTORIES
    S->>S: Log activity consentGranted
    S-->>C: List of CreateConsentResponse
    C-->>W: 200 OK
